\title{Vikraman's Forest}
\author{vikraman}
\meta{author}{false}

\p{
  This is [[vikraman]]'s public forest, built using the [forester](https://www.forester-notes.org) tool.
  It contains some rough notes and collections of trees, mostly for myself, and to send some stuff around to people.
}

\p{
  I use a beeminder goal so that I keep updating this forest regularly.
